def content_hash(content: str) -> str
class ShadowStorage(ABC): ...
class MemoryShadowStorage(ShadowStorage): ...
```
Methods observed in use: `retrieve(shadow_id) -> str | None`,
`get_shadow_for_path(source) -> str | None`, `get_cached_compressed(shadow_id) -> str | None`.
A store/save method exists — **UNVERIFIED** exact name/signature.
`ParitokConfig.shadow_storage` also accepts `"redis"`; no Redis class is exported from
