## 11. `paritok.strategies`

- `local_model.LocalModelStrategy(config: LocalModelConfig)` — default Ollama/OpenAI-compatible path.
  Helpers: `_ratio_to_level(target_ratio)`, `_strip_thinking(text)`, `_unwrap_seg(raw)`.
- `gpu_server.GpuServerStrategy(config: GpuServerConfig)` — hosted path.
- `chunking.split_into_chunks_structural(...)`, `chunking.deduplicate_definitions(text)`
- `prompts.system_prompt_for_kind(kind: str | None) -> str` (loads from `strategies/system_prompts/`)
- `tagger.classify_segment_kind(msg, position_idx)`, `reclassify_tool_result(kind, content)`,
  `classify_kind_from_content(content)`, `detect_stale_files(segments)`,
  `assign_level(seg, seg_idx, total_segs, ...)`, `tag_messages(messages) -> list[dict]`

SEG levels are `L0`-`L3` (L0 = model default, per the `compress(level=...)` docstring).
**UNVERIFIED**: exact target ratio each level maps to.

Note: compression strategies are **not** a user-selectable config knob. The only config-level
"strategy" selector is `tool_discovery.strategy` (`"embedding"` | `"relevance"` |
`"passthrough"`); the compression strategy is chosen implicitly by `use_gpu_server`.

---

## 12. CLI (click) — `paritok/cli.py`

Group: `main()` — "Paritok: Open-source agent context compression." with `@click.version_option()`.

| Command | Options |
|---|---|
| `paritok init` | `--force` (flag, overwrite existing), `--path` (default `paritok.yaml`) |
| `paritok config` | none — prints resolved config (backend, compression thresholds, active model block, tool discovery, shadow storage) |
| `paritok proxy` | `--host` (`127.0.0.1`), `--port` (`8080`), `--anthropic-url` (`https://api.anthropic.com`), `--openai-url` (`https://api.openai.com`), `--config-file` (existing path), `--log-level` (`debug\|info\|warning\|error`, default `info`) |
| `paritok up` | same as `proxy` **plus** `--registry-model` (default `paritok/paritok-4b-v1`) |

Both `proxy` and `up` auto-pick up `./paritok.yaml` when `--config-file` is omitted, and both
call `_maybe_write_codex_config(cfg, host, port)` before serving. `up` additionally runs
`_ensure_ollama_model(local_model, registry_model, base_url)` when `use_gpu_server` is false,
raising `ClickException` if the model can't be prepared.

```python
def run_proxy(
    host: str = "127.0.0.1",
    port: int = 8080,
    anthropic_base_url: str = "https://api.anthropic.com",
    openai_base_url: str = "https://api.openai.com",
    config_path: str | None = None,
    log_level: str = "info",
):  # paritok/proxy/server.py:1262 — raises ImportError if uvicorn missing
```

